stateDiagram-v2
[*] --> Protected
Protected --> Chunked
Chunked --> LLM: per-chunk prompt+budget
LLM --> Structured: output ok
LLM --> Fallback: timeout/too-similar
Fallback --> Structured: deterministicSimplifier()
Structured --> Glossary
Glossary --> Unprotected
Unprotected --> Validated: validateIntegrity()
Validated --> [*]: pass
Validated --> Fallback: fail -> deterministicSimplifier()+retry
